Hebei, China, July 5, 2007

3
00:00:14,690 --> 00:00:17,220
Dear Congratulations!

4
00:00:18,180 --> 00:00:23,880
We are pleased to tell you that you have won the high school speaking competition about

5
00:00:23,880 --> 00:00:24,960
New Tangshan.

6
00:00:25,520 --> 00:00:28,860
Your speech was heard by a group of five judges,

7
